                    %msub
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} ]
                      %mi inj
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} Id : [D,C]_{proj} \longrightarrow [D,C]_{inj}
              being the left Quillen functor).
            %p
              If
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi D
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} D
              is a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Reedy+category"} Reedy category
              this factors through the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Reedy+model+structure"} Reedy model structure
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} [
                    %mi D
                    %mo ,
                    %mi C
                    %msub
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} ]
